{"slug":"le-bal","title":"Le Bal","author":"Irène Némirovsky","year":1930,"blurb":"Paris, the 1920s. A newly rich mother throws a grand ball and bans her fourteen-year-old daughter from it. The daughter has two hundred invitations to post.","level":"A2+ vocabulary · B1 grammar","added":"2026-11-26T21","words":1145,"chapters":7,"book":[{"fr":"Une famille nouvellement riche","en":"A newly rich family","p":[[[[["Antoinette"]," ",["Kampf"]," ",["avait"]," ",["quatorze"]," ",["ans"],", ",["et"]," ",["elle"]," ",["vivait"]," ",["à"]," ",["Paris"]," ",["avec"]," ",["ses"]," ",["parents"],"."],"Antoinette Kampf was fourteen, and she lived in Paris with her parents."],[[["Depuis"]," ",["deux"]," ",["ans"],", ",["sa"]," ",["famille"]," ",["était"]," ",["très"]," ",["riche"],"."],"For two years, her family had been very rich."],[[["Avant"],", ",["son"]," ",["père"]," ",["travaillait"]," ",["dans"]," ",["une"]," ",["banque"],", ",["et"]," ",["sa"]," ",["mère"]," ",["tapait"]," ",["des"]," ",["lettres"]," ",["dans"]," ",["un"]," ",["bureau"],"."],"Before, her father worked in a bank, and her mother typed letters in an office."],[[["Puis"],", ",["un"]," ",["jour"],", ",["M"],". ",["Kampf"]," ",["a"]," ",["joué"]," ",["à"]," ",["la"]," ",["Bourse"],", ",["et"]," ",["il"]," ",["a"]," ",["gagné"]," ",["des"]," ",["millions"],"."],"Then one day, Mr Kampf gambled on the stock exchange, and he won millions."],[[["Maintenant"],", ",["ils"]," ",["habitaient"]," ",["dans"]," ",["un"]," ",["grand"]," ",["appartement"]," ",["neuf"],", ",["avec"]," ",["des"]," ",["tapis"]," ",["épais"],", ",["des"]," ",["tableaux"]," ",["et"]," ",["des"]," ",["domestiques"],"."],"Now they lived in a big new apartment, with thick carpets, paintings and servants."]],[[[["Mais"]," ",["Mme"]," ",["Kampf"]," ",["n'"],["était"]," ",["pas"]," ",["heureuse"],"."],"But Mrs Kampf wasn't happy."],[[["Elle"]," ",["avait"]," ",["de"]," ",["l'"],["argent"],", ",["de"]," ",["belles"]," ",["robes"]," ",["et"]," ",["des"]," ",["bijoux"],", ",["mais"]," ",["personne"]," ",["ne"]," ",["la"]," ",["connaissait"],"."],"She had money, beautiful dresses and jewellery, but nobody knew her."],[[["Les"]," ",["gens"]," ",["chics"]," ",["de"]," ",["Paris"]," ",["ne"]," ",["l'"],["invitaient"]," ",["jamais"]," ",["chez"]," ",["eux"],"."],"The fashionable people of Paris never invited her to their homes."],[[["Elle"]," ",["avait"]," ",["peur"]," ",["aussi"]," ",["de"]," ",["vieillir"],"."],"She was also afraid of getting old."],[[["Tous"]," ",["les"]," ",["matins"],", ",["elle"]," ",["regardait"]," ",["son"]," ",["visage"]," ",["dans"]," ",["le"]," ",["miroir"],", ",["et"]," ",["elle"]," ",["cherchait"]," ",["les"]," ",["rides"],"."],"Every morning, she looked at her face in the mirror, and she searched for wrinkles."]],[[[["Antoinette"],", ",["elle"],", ",["était"]," ",["une"]," ",["jeune"]," ",["fille"]," ",["maigre"]," ",["et"]," ",["timide"],", ",["avec"]," ",["de"]," ",["longues"]," ",["jambes"]," ",["et"]," ",["de"]," ",["grands"]," ",["pieds"],"."],"Antoinette herself was a thin, shy girl, with long legs and big feet."],[[["Elle"]," ",["passait"]," ",["ses"]," ",["journées"]," ",["avec"]," ",["Miss"]," ",["Betty"],", ",["sa"]," ",["gouvernante"]," ",["anglaise"],"."],"She spent her days with Miss Betty, her English governess."],[[["Sa"]," ",["mère"]," ",["la"]," ",["critiquait"]," ",["sans"]," ",["arrêt"]," : « ",["Tiens-toi"]," ",["droite"]," ! ",["Ne"]," ",["parle"]," ",["pas"]," ",["si"]," ",["fort"]," ! ",["Regarde"]," ",["tes"]," ",["mains"],", ",["elles"]," ",["sont"]," ",["sales"]," ! »"],"Her mother criticised her constantly: 'Stand up straight! Don't talk so loudly! Look at your hands, they're dirty!'"],[[["Antoinette"]," ",["baissait"]," ",["la"]," ",["tête"]," ",["et"]," ",["ne"]," ",["disait"]," ",["rien"],"."],"Antoinette lowered her head and said nothing."],[[["Mais"]," ",["dans"]," ",["son"]," ",["cœur"],", ",["elle"]," ",["était"]," ",["pleine"]," ",["de"]," ",["colère"],"."],